      'Enterprise Risk Management isn\'t about preventing every loss, it\'s about ensuring you can see the full picture. The London Whale, Credit Suisse, and SVB all shared the same root cause: no one person or system had an enterprise-wide view of total risk. ERM closes the gaps between silos, makes risk visible before it materializes, and ensures that no single risk, or combination of risks, can threaten the organization\'s survival.'
